  title "The Space Between Tremors"
  summary "At the E'frostlings' market, Zheishongfeihua, the chief assessor, discovers a shipment discrepancy and struggles with a tremor in her left flipper—a physical manifestation of a debt incurred from the tunnels below. During the Circle Gathering under the aurora, she encounters Qingoqa aihua'Mist-wrought, a herald bearing her own scar from the tunnels, and the two recognize in each other a shared corruption from that forbidden place. In the gathering's final moment, Zheishongfeihua offers Qingoqa her Compass of Crystal—an artifact with thirteen segments instead of twelve, representing a cost that cannot be repaid—and they stand together at the threshold between their separate worlds, neither crossing nor withdrawing."
